1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 11]</font>

15
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

16
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

17
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

18
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get you out of here.</font>

19
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

20
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't go in there.</font>

21
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao has already gone in.</font>

22
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'm going in too.</font>

23
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

24
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang!</font>

25
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

26
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, it's dangerous.</font>

27
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mustn't go in, Mr. Jiang.</font>

28
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, it's too dangerous.</font>

29
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You can't go in.
- Let go!</font>

30
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Qinglan.
- Chief.</font>

31
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

32
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

33
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is she?</font>

34
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She just inhaled too much smoke.</font>

35
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She will be fine.</font>

36
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you all standing there for?</font>

37
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fetch a physician at once.</font>

38
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put out the fire.</font>

39
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Go!
- Yes.</font>

40
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How was Qinglan trapped in the room?</font>

41
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't Jinyi already rush out?</font>

42
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she wakes up,</font>

43
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the truth will come to light.</font>

44
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one behind Steward Zhou</font>

45
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be Princess Changle.</font>

46
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang,</font>

47
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's actually quite clever of you.</font>

48
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

49
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

50
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the cleverest.</font>

51
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what if we know?</font>

52
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have no proof.</font>

53
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We still can't do anything to them.</font>

54
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been at daggers drawn
with Changle for years.</font>

55
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There will be an outcome,
sooner or later.</font>

56
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me be frank.</font>

57
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you do,</font>

58
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's none of my concern.</font>

59
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now Qinglan</font>

60
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been dragged into this turmoil.</font>

61
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is bound to hold a grudge
against her.</font>

62
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet she still insists
on getting close to Changle.</font>

63
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one can stop her.</font>

64
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what's happening:</font>

65
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When immortals fight,</font>

66
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mortals suffer.</font>

67
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you getting at?</font>

68
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to ask you this:</font>

69
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you and Qinglan
know each other before?</font>

70
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">More than that.</font>

71
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She didn't even tell you that, did she?</font>

72
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she?</font>

73
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that I didn't want to ask.</font>

74
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just didn't want to put her
in a difficult spot.</font>

75
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not like you.</font>

76
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was almost
at Princess Changle's Mansion,</font>

77
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you had to bring her
into your mansion.</font>

78
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she worked for me,</font>

79
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she ate well and slept soundly.</font>

80
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since she became your wife,</font>

81
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she got dragged into the fight
with Changle.</font>

82
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been racking her brains</font>

83
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and nearly lost her life over it.</font>

84
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to speak.</font>

85
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just feel ashamed.</font>

86
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The case is almost closed now.</font>

87
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have any conscience left...</font>

88
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you.</font>

89
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go.</font>

90
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're awake.</font>

91
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hurt?</font>

92
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

93
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's perfectly fine.</font>

94
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just woke up.</font>

95
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some water.</font>

96
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't talk for now.</font>

97
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

98
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you to keep quiet?</font>

99
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly happened last night?</font>

100
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why were you in Jinyi's room?</font>

101
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Jinyi?</font>

102
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to see her.</font>

103
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

104
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court of Judicial Review</font>

105
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">took away Steward Zhou's body.</font>

106
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The mansion is in chaos.</font>

107
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many servants are demanding to leave.</font>

108
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some are even stirring up trouble.</font>

109
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should we handle this?</font>

110
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm everyone down.</font>

111
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Arrest the ringleaders.</font>

112
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prevent more from being incited.</font>

113
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

114
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

115
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court of Judicial Review's soldiers</font>

116
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have all withdrawn.</font>

117
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we need to reorganize</font>

118
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the security arrangements here?</font>

119
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

120
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gather the men at South Courtyard.</font>

121
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle it shortly.</font>

122
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

123
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We truly can't do without Jinyi.</font>

124
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

125
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're in such a state.</font>

126
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet the Prince still lets you toil away.</font>

127
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sharing the Prince's burdens</font>

128
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is our duty as his subordinates.</font>

129
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guard your tongue.</font>

130
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the ledger.</font>

131
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the Prince?</font>

132
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's been watching
over Ms. Jun in her room.</font>

133
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

134
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince needs you.</font>

135
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, you needed me?</font>

136
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's me who wants to see you.</font>

137
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, what do you require of me?</font>

138
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

139
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that we are all seated here.</font>

140
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Must I tell the Prince</font>

141
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what you did last night,</font>

142
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">little by little?</font>

143
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

144
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is the meaning of this?</font>

145
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you trying to kill me yesterday?</font>

146
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you forget so quickly?</font>

147
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

148
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you mean she was the one
who attacked you?</font>

149
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

150
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you claim I tried to kill you.</font>

151
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your proof?</font>

152
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought that last night,</font>

153
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you risked your life
to help me escape,</font>

154
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was to deliver a message
to the Prince.</font>

155
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was grateful in my heart.</font>

156
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined that today,</font>

157
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would come to frame me instead.</font>

158
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are making a vile accusation!</font>

159
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to save you,</font>

160
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only to find Steward Zhou's corpse.</font>

161
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wanted to stage a scene,</font>

162
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">making it look
like Steward Zhou killed me.</font>

163
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Prince hadn't arrived in time,</font>

164
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would likely be dead by now.</font>

165
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask you.</font>

166
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I truly wanted you dead,</font>

167
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why would I have waited</font>

168
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until I ended up looking like this?</font>

169
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

170
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">say something.</font>

171
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This happened in your residence.</font>

172
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

173
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have been utterly loyal to the Prince.</font>

174
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even sacrificed my appearance,</font>

175
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what a woman values most.</font>

176
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what about you?</font>

177
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You betrayed him once before.</font>

178
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we trace it back like this,</font>

179
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could we suspect</font>

180
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you were involved</font>

181
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Steward Zhou incident?</font>

182
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why you were in my room.</font>

183
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your ability to blame the victim</font>

184
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is truly admirable.</font>

185
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I blaming the victim,</font>

186
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or are you trying to sow discord</font>

187
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between the Prince and me?</font>

188
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

189
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you had succeeded,</font>

190
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this mansion would soon be</font>

191
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under your command, wouldn't it?</font>

192
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

193
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've said all I have to say.</font>

194
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for whom you choose to believe,</font>

195
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that is entirely up to you.</font>

196
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou is already dead.</font>

197
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you two have said</font>

198
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and who is telling the truth</font>

199
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cannot be verified now.</font>

200
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are both injured.</font>

201
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back and rest for now.</font>

202
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk once your wounds have healed.</font>

203
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take my leave.</font>

204
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

205
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems to me that, in this mansion,</font>

206
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there isn't
a single clear-headed person.</font>

207
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

208
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you back.</font>

209
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

210
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Focus on your recovery.</font>

211
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have Physician Liu
take your pulse shortly.</font>

212
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep living in your pipe dream.</font>

213
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

214
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan is leaving with me.</font>

215
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

216
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take me to see Steward Zhou's body.</font>

217
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou's body</font>

218
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was burned beyond recognition.</font>

219
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court of Judicial Review
has examined it.</font>

220
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said nothing could be determined.</font>

221
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

222
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell me.</font>

223
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly goes through your mind?</font>

224
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had a fine post,</font>

225
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you had to come here</font>

226
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and suffer this humiliation?</font>

227
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is not an unreasonable man.</font>

228
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this matter,</font>

229
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi and I have conflicting accounts.</font>

230
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It all depends on whom he believes.</font>

231
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who else would he believe?</font>

232
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You nearly died, you know?</font>

233
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi only suffered a few scratches.</font>

234
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any clear-minded person
can see the truth.</font>

235
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet he still stands there,</font>

236
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wavering and stalling.</font>

237
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's obvious he doesn't trust you.</font>

238
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Prince Duan</font>

239
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must have had his wits knocked loose
by that falling beam.</font>

240
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't tell right from wrong anymore.</font>

241
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speaking ill of me in my mansion.</font>

242
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that not too much, Mr. Jiang?</font>

243
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eavesdropping on us.</font>

244
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How rude.</font>

245
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop. Enough with the knocking!</font>

246
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's driving me mad.</font>

247
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am,</font>

248
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your mind is unsettled.</font>

249
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps you should copy some scriptures.</font>

250
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense.</font>

251
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You make me look at your face every day.</font>

252
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could my mind possibly settle?</font>

253
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out of my sight at once!</font>

254
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

255
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to see you.</font>

256
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has His Majesty sent any word?</font>

257
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When exactly will I</font>

258
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get out of this wretched place?</font>

259
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, you must</font>

260
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">endure it a while longer.</font>

261
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust it will be soon.</font>

262
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That brother of mine</font>

263
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has truly grown far too bold.</font>

264
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knows I'm targeting Li Congyao,</font>

265
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he's deliberately stalling for time.</font>

266
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any news from Prince Duan's Mansion?</font>

267
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou...</font>

268
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He...</font>

269
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is dead.</font>

270
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You worthless fools!</font>

271
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't handle a single task properly.</font>

272
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out of my sight, now!</font>

273
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

274
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

275
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

276
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you have further orders?</font>

277
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

278
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin asked me</font>

279
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bring you a gift.</font>

280
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said he made it himself for you.</font>

281
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never thought</font>

282
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the one who still thinks of me</font>

283
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be him.</font>

284
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin even enshrined a Buddha statue.</font>

285
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

286
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he wishes to accompany you</font>

287
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in fasting and praying to Buddha.</font>

288
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall remember</font>

289
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this devotion well.</font>

290
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What news?</font>

291
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have learned</font>

292
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Ms. Jun has left the residence</font>

293
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and returned to her post.</font>

294
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good. You may go back now.</font>

295
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

296
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

297
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to protect your mansion</font>

298
00:11:58,800 --> 00:11:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you,</font>

299
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no other choice.</font>

300
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only hope it all ends here.</font>

301
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei has left.</font>

302
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She should never come back.</font>

303
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

304
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My inner strength has just recovered.</font>

305
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hadn't had the chance
to report it yet.</font>

306
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I offended you just now.</font>

307
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive me, Your Highness.</font>

308
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know Jun Qinglan
left the mansion?</font>

309
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sent her to examine
Steward Zhou's body.</font>

310
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A person burned to death in a fire</font>

311
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would surely struggle in the flames.</font>

312
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their mouth would be full of ash.</font>

313
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Steward Zhou's body,</font>

314
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">though burned beyond recognition,</font>

315
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had a clean mouth.</font>

316
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This means the fire started</font>

317
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after he was already dead.</font>

318
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only you and Jun Qinglan were there.</font>

319
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou</font>

320
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">killed so many people</font>

321
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without being noticed.</font>

322
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe</font>

323
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Jun Qinglan alone</font>

324
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could not have handled him.</font>

325
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

326
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you doubting me?</font>

327
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But at that time,</font>

328
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my inner strength had not yet recovered.</font>

329
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You saw me</font>

330
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">run out to beg for your help.</font>

331
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's easy to verify.</font>

332
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only need to find someone</font>

333
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with inner strength equal to yours</font>

334
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have them take ten Weakening Pills,</font>

335
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then we will know</font>

336
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if your inner strength was truly gone.</font>

337
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi,</font>

338
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you stand by what you just said?</font>

339
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

340
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did kill</font>

341
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou.</font>

342
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he was forcing me to betray you,</font>

343
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">trying to make me help him escape.</font>

344
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I did it.</font>

345
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then?</font>

346
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then Jun Qinglan arrived.</font>

347
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her timing was too convenient.</font>

348
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feared Changle
had let her in on purpose</font>

349
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to help Steward Zhou get away.</font>

350
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I used that method.</font>

351
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

352
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I admit my guilt.</font>

353
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am ready to accept punishment.</font>

354
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this matter,</font>

355
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you acted for the mansion.</font>

356
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

357
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why did you let Jun Qinglan go?</font>

358
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't me, Your Highness.</font>

359
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was...</font>

360
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Steward Zhou.</font>

361
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do with me.</font>

362
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou has been
in the mansion for years.</font>

363
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knew well of your loyalty to me.</font>

364
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When he was cornered,</font>

365
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he specifically sought you out.</font>

366
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This means</font>

367
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he had something to bargain with you.</font>

368
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe</font>

369
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that when you let Jun Qinglan go,</font>

370
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he happened to catch you in the act.</font>

371
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He then used it to blackmail you.</font>

372
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you killed him. Am I right?</font>

373
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

374
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing escapes you, Your Highness.</font>

375
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have one final question for you.</font>

376
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years ago,</font>

377
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were the one who let her go, right?</font>

378
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

379
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I opened the gate five years ago.</font>

380
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I opened it for her again
five years later.</font>

381
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these years,</font>

382
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have served the mansion
with utmost devotion.</font>

383
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I entrusted you
with great responsibility.</font>

384
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet for your own selfish desires,</font>

385
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have betrayed me time and again.</font>

386
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know the consequences</font>

387
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of betraying me.</font>

388
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must accept that.</font>

389
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not blame me for being merciless.</font>

390
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I accept that.</font>

391
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, all that was said</font>

392
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was meant to explain things to her.</font>

393
00:16:50,580 --> 00:16:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

394
00:16:53,450 --> 00:16:54,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

395
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

396
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:03,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

397
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

398
00:17:07,700 --> 00:17:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

399
00:17:12,230 --> 00:17:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

400
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:22,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

401
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

402
00:17:29,370 --> 00:17:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

403
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

404
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:40,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

405
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

406
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
